# AgentSec Python SDK

AI Agent Security Monitoring Platform - Python SDK.

## Installation

```bash
pip install agentsec-sdk
```

## Basic Usage

```python
import agentsec

agentsec.init()
# ... your agent code ...
agentsec.shutdown()
```
